        },
        {
          "type": "sidebox",
          "title": "When neither fits",
          "items": [
            "Iterative accumulation with feedback",
            "Each step depends on the previous result",
            "Use a recursive CTE, not a window"
          ],
          "ink": "accent"
        },
        {
          "type": "callout",
          "style": "takeaway",
          "title": "Rule of thumb",
          "text": "Joining a table to itself on an inequality to get context? A window function is almost certainly the right rewrite."
        }
