          }
        },
        {
          "type": "bullets",
          "items": [
            "Windows cannot appear in WHERE, GROUP BY or HAVING",
            "Not at the same query level — wrap in a CTE to filter",
            "WHERE runs first, so filtered rows leave the window too",
            "A WHERE that drops rows drops them from every running total"
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "heading",
          "text": "What the Engine Does"
        },
        {
          "type": "bullets",
